WEBVTT

00:05:28.913 --> 00:05:31.371
But I truly, genuinely believe that

00:05:31.371 --> 00:05:35.829
the positive impacts will be orders of
magnitude bigger than the negative ones.

00:05:36.163 --> 00:05:38.204
I think we're seeing a
glimpse of that now.

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:41.579
Now that we have the first general
purpose built out in the world

00:05:41.579 --> 00:05:43.413
and available via things like RPI,

00:05:43.829 --> 00:05:45.621
I think we are seeing evidence of just

00:05:45.621 --> 00:05:49.246
the breadth of services that
we will be able to offer as

00:05:49.246 --> 00:05:51.746
the sort of technological revolution
really takes hold.

00:05:52.079 --> 00:05:57.496
And we will have people interact with
services that are smart, really smart,

00:05:57.788 --> 00:06:00.496
and it will feel like as strange as